{
    "title": "Bingo Lotto: Win Lucky Number",
    "description": "Has the word <b>\u201cBINGO\u201d</b> been on your mind? Our <b>Bingo Lotto app</b> can take you on a fascinating lottery games! No need to bring cash, bring lots of fun \ud83e\udd29\r\n\r\nPlease keep in mind that there is no real cash, or any type of money involved. Our online bingoplus games just for your fun \ud83d\udc67\r\n\r\n<h2>TAKE A PEEK AT OUR LOTTO GAMES GOODIES</h2>\r\nOur loto slots game has a new impressive style of 75-Ball cards\r\nAll central slots are ALWAYS already done for you!\r\nFill in the rest of the slots with 24 numbers and win the lottery!\r\nPlay bingo plus OR have an awesome online loto party with friends \ud83e\udd73\r\n\r\n<h2>LOOK AT COOL FEATURES OF AT YOUR FINGERTIPS</h2>\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Get a blast playing bingoplus games with folks from all over the world!!\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Earn virtual rewards with your lucky 5x5 cards, usable only within the game!\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Fill in squares not only with numbers but also with <b>\u201cB-I-N-G-O\u201d</b> letters. Makes it easier to win!\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Don't worry about the central square. It always fills up automatically!\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Play on any mobile device\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Enjoy a super convenient 5x5 slot layout\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Stay fascinated with super-fast bingoplus game\u2019s uploads\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Play double/triple bingo plus and double and win!\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Binge-play up to 8 cards in each lucky loto\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 Enjoy a super friendly user interface. Gaming is just the way you like it!\r\n\r\n<h2>LEARN BASIC RULES OF OUR GAME AND GET THE BALL ROLLING</h2>\r\n\r\nThe rules loto are simple but fun: your 1st letter is \u201cB\u201d. Then numbers from 1 to 15 would correspond to this letter. Now, you need to come up with the letter \u201cI\u201d. In this case, the range from 16 to 30 will correspond to it. Now, make up the desired word <b>\"BINGO\"</b> with the rest of the letters - \u201cN\u201d, \u201cG\u201d, and \u201cO\u201d. And you\u2019re all set \ud83c\udfaf\r\nPlay either bingo plus or team up with colleagues for a fun little bingoplus during your lunch break. Add some excitement to your daily routine! Grow your circle of friends and have a bunch of fun win lottery games. With our loto slots game, you don\u2019t need money to be a lucky one!\r\n\r\nOnce you try our lotto games, don\u2019t be shy and share your story with us. We\u2019d love to hear from you! Write a quick review and leave a comment down below to let us know what you think about the app. Go ahead, give us feedback about your gaming wins! \ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://severex.io/privacy/\r\nTerms of Use: http://severex.io/terms/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Has the word <b>\u201cBINGO\u201d</b> been on your mind? Our <b>Bingo Lotto app</b> can take you on a fascinating lottery games! No need to bring cash, bring lots of fun \ud83e\udd29<br><br>Please keep in mind that there is no real cash, or any type of money involved. Our online bingoplus games just for your fun \ud83d\udc67<br><br><h2>TAKE A PEEK AT OUR LOTTO GAMES GOODIES</h2><br>Our loto slots game has a new impressive style of 75-Ball cards<br>All central slots are ALWAYS already done for you!<br>Fill in the rest of the slots with 24 numbers and win the lottery!<br>Play bingo plus OR have an awesome online loto party with friends \ud83e\udd73<br><br><h2>LOOK AT COOL FEATURES OF AT YOUR FINGERTIPS</h2><br>\ud83c\udfb1 Get a blast playing bingoplus games with folks from all over the world!!<br>\ud83c\udfb1 Earn virtual rewards with your lucky 5x5 cards, usable only within the game!<br>\ud83c\udfb1 Fill in squares not only with numbers but also with <b>\u201cB-I-N-G-O\u201d</b> letters. Makes it easier to win!<br>\ud83c\udfb1 Don&#39;t worry about the central square. It always fills up automatically!<br>\ud83c\udfb1 Play on any mobile device<br>\ud83c\udfb1 Enjoy a super convenient 5x5 slot layout<br>\ud83c\udfb1 Stay fascinated with super-fast bingoplus game\u2019s uploads<br>\ud83c\udfb1 Play double/triple bingo plus and double and win!<br>\ud83c\udfb1 Binge-play up to 8 cards in each lucky loto<br>\ud83c\udfb1 Enjoy a super friendly user interface. Gaming is just the way you like it!<br><br><h2>LEARN BASIC RULES OF OUR GAME AND GET THE BALL ROLLING</h2><br><br>The rules loto are simple but fun: your 1st letter is \u201cB\u201d. Then numbers from 1 to 15 would correspond to this letter. Now, you need to come up with the letter \u201cI\u201d. In this case, the range from 16 to 30 will correspond to it. Now, make up the desired word <b>&quot;BINGO&quot;</b> with the rest of the letters - \u201cN\u201d, \u201cG\u201d, and \u201cO\u201d. And you\u2019re all set \ud83c\udfaf<br>Play either bingo plus or team up with colleagues for a fun little bingoplus during your lunch break. Add some excitement to your daily routine! Grow your circle of friends and have a bunch of fun win lottery games. With our loto slots game, you don\u2019t need money to be a lucky one!<br><br>Once you try our lotto games, don\u2019t be shy and share your story with us. We\u2019d love to hear from you! Write a quick review and leave a comment down below to let us know what you think about the app. Go ahead, give us feedback about your gaming wins! \ud83c\udfc6<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://severex.io/privacy/<br>Terms of Use: http://severex.io/terms/",
